usage: csk [-h] [--version]
           {bootstrap,init,skill,install,update,upgrade,global,audit,status,gc,add,remove,hybrid,list,project,config,shell-init}
           ...

CocoaSkill local skill manager

positional arguments:
  {bootstrap,init,skill,install,update,upgrade,global,audit,status,gc,add,remove,hybrid,list,project,config,shell-init}
    bootstrap           Create global config (interactive, or scripted with
                        flags).
    init                Create project Skillfile.json and CocoaSkill gitignore
                        block.
    skill               Inspect and validate skill repositories.
    install             Apply Skillfile.json using local refs. Missing git URL
                        sources are cloned.
    update              Fetch all local skill repositories under skills_root.
    upgrade             Fetch the selected project dependency closure, then
                        install.
    global              Manage user-wide global skills.
    audit               Run deterministic static security audit for declared
                        skills.
    status              Show manifest vs installed state.
    gc                  Remove unreferenced runtime, snapshot, and protected
                        build-cache entries plus dead consumer registry
                        entries.
    add                 Add or replace a skill declaration in the project
                        Skillfile.
    remove              Remove a skill declaration from the project Skillfile.
    hybrid              Manage machine-level hybrid skills activated for
                        selected projects.
    list                List configured projects and declared skills.
    project             Manage configured projects.
    config              Inspect csk config.
    shell-init          Print or install shell hook code for PATH activation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             print csk version and exit

Local documentation index:
  csk bootstrap          create ~/.cocoaskills/config.json
  csk init [path]        create project Skillfile.json and gitignore block
  csk install [target]   apply Skillfile.json; clone missing URL sources
  csk update             fetch local skill repositories
  csk upgrade [target]   fetch the target dependency closure, then install
  csk status [target]    show manifest vs installed state
  csk global <command>   manage user-wide global skills
  csk audit [target]     run deterministic security audit
  csk skill check <dir>  validate one skill directory
  csk list               list configured projects and skills
  csk project add        add a configured project
  csk project resolve    show current checkout resolution
  csk config show        show config path and content
  csk shell-init         print or install shell hook code

Run 'csk <command> --help' for command-specific documentation.
